    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Stryker 1.0.6 — permission screen no longer traps you",
      "description": "Fixed: the intro 'Grant Permission' screen used to block the app when some permission could not be granted (OEM hides all-files access, Android 13 media dialogs, 'don't ask again'). It now tries to grant everything and always advances — the app opens regardless and falls back to app-private storage.",
